    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Ils vont de ville en ville, un chapiteau sur le dos, leur spectacle en bandouli\u00e8re. Dans nos vies ils apportent le r\u00eave et le d\u00e9sordre. Ce sont des ogres, des g\u00e9ants, ils en ont mang\u00e9 du th\u00e9\u00e2tre et des kilom\u00e8tres. Mais l\u2019arriv\u00e9e imminente d\u2019un b\u00e9b\u00e9 et le retour d\u2019une ancienne amante vont raviver des blessures que l\u2019on croyait oubli\u00e9es. Alors que la f\u00eate commence !",
        "english": "They go from town to town, a big top on their backs, their show over their shoulder. They bring dreams and disorder to our lives. They are ogres, giants. They've devored the theater and miles and miles of road. But the imminent arrival of a baby and the return of a former lover will make old wounds, which we thought had been forgotten, resurface. So the party begins!"
